ad_yarbo","topic":"Lead time: Yarbo","brand":"yarbo","kind":"lead","status":"confirmed","short":"usually delivered in 10 to 14 days","days_max":14,"text":"Usually delivered in 10 to 14 days, from Yarbo's US warehouses after payment.","source":"Owner confirmed 2026-10-06: Yarbo confirmed 10 to 14 days from its US warehouses after payment.","checked":"2026-10-06"},{"id":"lead_mowrator","topic":"Lead time: Mowrator","brand":"mowrator","kind":"lead","status":"confirmed","short":"usually delivered in 7 to 10 business days","days_max":10,"text":"Free shipping on most Mowrator items, usually 7 to 10 business days.","source":"Brand facts verified 2026-09-24","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"lead_aiper","topic":"Lead time: Aiper","brand":"aiper","kind":"lead","status":"confirmed","short":"usually delivered in 10 to 14 business days","days_max":14,"text":"Free shipping on most Aiper items, usually 10 to 14 business days.","source":"Brand facts verified 2026-09-24","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"lead_betta","topic":"Lead time: Betta","brand":"betta","kind":"lead","status":"confirmed","short":"shipped in 1 to 2 business days, then 1 to 6 days in transit","days_max":8,"text":"Free ground shipping in the contiguous US. Betta ships in 1 to 2 business days, then 1 to 6 days in transit.","source":"Betta FAQ, verified 2026-09-24","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"lead_wybot","topic":"Lead time: WYBOT","brand":"wybot","kind":"lead","status":"confirmed","short":"processed within 2 business days, then 3 to 7 business days in transit","days_max":9,"text":"WYBOT ships it directly. Free shipping in the contiguous US, processed within 2 business days, then 3 to 7 business days. Not to Alaska, Hawaii, Rhode Island, US territories or PO boxes.","source":"WYBOT via Shopify Collective, verified 2026-09-24","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"lead_hobot","topic":"Lead time: HOBOT","brand":"hobot","kind":"lead","status":"pending","text":"","safe_line":"Let me confirm the shipping time for that model and call you straight back.","source":"Store knowledge base 2026-09-26 (live policies and owner rules)","checked":"2026-10-06","note":"HOBOT ships free within the contiguous US. Delivery time not confirmed yet."},{"id":"delivery_method","topic":"How a Yarbo arrives","status":"pending","text":"","safe_line":"I want to give you the exact delivery details rather than guess: how many boxes and how it comes off the truck. Let me confirm and call you back.","source":"Owner decision 11 (freight or parcel, liftgate, box count)","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"returns","topic":"Returns","kind":"returns","status":"confirmed","text":"You can return it within 30 days of delivery. Used consumables and pre-orders that have already shipped can't be returned. Email us first so we can confirm with the supplier. If it arrived defective, damaged or wrong, the supplier covers the costs. For any other return, you pay the return shipping. There's no restocking fee.","safe_line":"You can cancel free any time before it ships. Once it has shipped, returns follow the maker's policy and return freight is at your cost. Let me confirm the exact terms for this model before you decide.","source":"Store knowledge base 2026-09-26 (live policies and owner rules)","checked":"2026-10-02"},{"id":"discounts","topic":"Discounts","status":"pending","text":"","safe_line":"I don't have a discount I can apply myself. Let me ask the owner what we can do for you and come back to you today.","source":"Owner decision: reps have no discount of their own; price match only, approved by the owner each time. Mowrator and Betta are never sold below the maker's minimum price. No deadline offer unless the owner creates a real code with a real expiry.","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"price_match","topic":"Price match","status":"confirmed","text":"We do have a price match policy. You place the order, then email us the other store's link and their price with shipping, and the team reviews it. I can't promise the result on the phone. Mowrator and Betta aren't eligible, because the makers set a minimum price.","safe_line":"If you've seen it cheaper from an authorised retailer, tell me where and I'll take it to the owner today. I can't approve a match myself.","source":"Store knowledge base 2026-09-26 (live policies and owner rules)","checked":"2026-10-02"},{"id":"warranty_yarbo","topic":"Warranty: Yarbo","brand":"yarbo","kind":"warranty","status":"confirmed","text":"Yarbo gives a 2-year limited warranty on the Core and modules. It excludes tracks, antennas and wear parts, is for residential use, and the customer may pay shipping both ways. We help you diagnose and prepare the claim; Yarbo decides it.","source":"Yarbo warranty, verified 2026-09-24","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"warranty_wybot","topic":"Warranty: WYBOT","brand":"wybot","kind":"warranty","status":"confirmed","text":"WYBOT's warranty is 1 year on the A1, B1 and F1, and 2 years on the C1, C2, C2 Vision, S2, S2 Solar and S2 Solar Vision. WYBOT handles the claim.","source":"WYBOT, verified 2026-09-24","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"warranty_betta","topic":"Warranty: Betta","brand":"betta","kind":"warranty","status":"confirmed","text":"Betta gives a 1-year warranty.","source":"Betta, verified 2026-09-24","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"warranty_hobot","topic":"Warranty: HOBOT","brand":"hobot","kind":"warranty","status":"confirmed","text":"HOBOT gives a 1-year limited warranty, through Home Robot LLC.","source":"HOBOT USA, verified 2026-09-25","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"warranty_mowrator","topic":"Warranty: Mowrator","brand":"mowrator","kind":"warranty","status":"confirmed","text":"Mowrator covers the machine, the remote and the battery for 2 years or 2,000 hours of home use, and the charger for 1 year. Business use comes under a separate Mowrator contract, so call us before ordering for that.","safe_line":"It comes with Mowrator's warranty, which is for residential use. Let me confirm the exact term for this model before you decide.","source":"Store knowledge base 2026-09-26 (live policies and owner rules)","checked":"2026-10-02"},{"id":"warranty_aiper","topic":"Warranty: Aiper","brand":"aiper","kind":"warranty","status":"confirmed","text":"Aiper's warranty is 3 years on the Scuba X1 Pro Max, 2 years on the Scuba N3, Scuba N1 Plus and EcoSurfer M2, and 1 year on the Scuba 800, from the purchase date with proof of purchase.","safe_line":"It comes with Aiper's warranty. Let me confirm the exact term for this model before you decide.","source":"Store knowledge base 2026-09-26 (live policies and owner rules)","checked":"2026-10-02"},{"id":"dealer_status","topic":"Authorized dealer","status":"confirmed","text":"We are an authorized dealer for Betta, HOBOT and Aiper. For Yarbo, Mowrator and WYBOT, do not use the words \"authorized dealer\"; say \"it comes with the manufacturer's warranty\" only where the fact sheet confirms the warranty.","source":"Owner, 2026-09-25","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"box_snow","topic":"What is in a Yarbo snow box","status":"pending","text":"","safe_line":"Let me confirm exactly what is in the box for the snow module so I don't sell you something that is already included.","source":"Owner decision 2. Do not call the module \"Gen 2\".","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"commercial","topic":"Business, HOA or rental use","status":"pending","text":"","safe_line":"The maker's standard warranty is for residential use. Let me check with the owner how we handle a business purchase before you decide.","source":"Owner decision 8","checked":"2026-10-01"},{"id":"charge_timing","topic":"When the card is charged","status":"confirmed","text":"Your card is pre-authorized when you order. We confirm stock with the supplier, then charge it and place the order. If the item turns out to be unavailable, the hold is released and we email you.","safe_line":"You'll see the full total before you confirm. Let me confirm exactly when the charge goes through and tell you before you pay.","source":"Store knowledge base 2026-09-26 (live policies and owner rules)","checked":"2026-10-02"},{"id":"netrtk","topic":"Y40P and NetRTK","status":"confirmed","text":"The Y40P positions with NetRTK, which is free but needs an internet connection and coverage at your address. Away from home Wi-Fi it relies on 4G, which is free for an initial period and then an optional paid plan. I'll check coverage for your address before you order.","source":"Yarbo. Never say \"no subscription ever\". Free 4G period length unverified.","checked":"2026-10-01"}]}{% endraw %}</script>
